---
import Base from "../../layouts/Base.astro";
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import banner from "../../assets/work/articles/twilight-banner.jpg";

const tags = ["Twilight", "Cycling", "Athens", "Event Coverage"];
---

<Base
  title="Former racer returns to Twilight Criterium | Grace Joy Park"
  description="Grace Joy Park's vignette on a former Twilight racer scouting the downtown Athens course before the 46th Athens Orthopedic Clinic Twilight Criterium."
>
  <p class="back"><a href="/work">&larr; Back to Writing</a></p>

  <article class="post">
    <h1>Former racer returns to Athens Orthopedic Clinic Twilight Criterium as vendors prepare for race weekend</h1>
    <p class="meta muted">Reporting I, Grady College &middot; April 17, 2026 &middot; By Grace Park</p>

    <ul class="tags">
      {tags.map((t) => <li>{t}</li>)}
    </ul>

    <figure class="hero">
      <Image
        src={banner}
        alt="Twilight Criterium banner over the Silver Dollar Bar"
        widths={[600, 900, 1200, 1600]}
        sizes="(max-width: 720px) 100vw, 900px"
        format="webp"
      />
      <figcaption>
        A banner for the 46th Athens Orthopedic Clinic Twilight Criterium hangs above the
        Silver Dollar Bar on Friday, April 17, 2026, ahead of the race weekend in downtown
        Athens. (Photo/Grace Park)
      </figcaption>
    </figure>

    <div class="prose">
      <p class="lede">
        Former Twilight racer Luke Harris rode through downtown Athens on Friday afternoon
        with the UGA Cycling group, scouting the course a day before the 46th Athens
        Orthopedic Clinic Twilight Criterium begins its pro races.
      </p>
      <p>
        &ldquo;We are here doing a little fun ride and checking all the stuff out today,&rdquo;
        Harris said. Harris came with the UGA Cycling group and previously competed at
        Twilight with Kingdom, a cycling team. He expressed excitement and anticipation
        for the upcoming men and women pro races.
      </p>
      <p>
        Around him, the 46th Athens Orthopedic Clinic Twilight Criterium was still
        preparing for its first full night. Food court vendors were setting up to serve
        the Athens community. Musicians ran through sound checks ahead of the ALL THINGS
        ATHENS concert on the Washington Street stage. Other cyclists rode through the
        streets, some stopping to do tricks or browse the vendor tents.
      </p>
    </div>

    <p class="full-link">
      <a href="/work/twilight-criterium.pdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
        Read the full story (PDF) &rarr;
      </a>
    </p>

    <section class="why-section">
      <h2>Why I Wrote The Story</h2>
      <p>
        Twilight pulls thousands of people into downtown Athens each spring, so even the
        day-before scene mattered to readers planning around the closures and the food
        court. Writing the vignette taught me to build a story in real time. I picked
        one source whose presence answered &ldquo;why come back?&rdquo; and used
        observation around him to set the scene without padding.
      </p>
    </section>
  </article>
</Base>

<style>
  .back { margin-bottom: 1rem; font-size: 0.95rem; }

  .post h1 {
    margin-bottom: 0.6rem;
    line-height: 1.25;
  }

  .meta {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .tags {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.4rem;
  }

  .tags li {
    border: 1px solid var(--rule);
    border-radius: 999px;
    padding: 0.15rem 0.7rem;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .hero {
    margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
  }

  .hero :global(img) {
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    display: block;
    border: 1px solid var(--rule);
  }

  .hero figcaption {
    margin-top: 0.6rem;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    font-style: italic;
    line-height: 1.5;
    max-width: 900px;
  }

  .prose p {
    max-width: 900px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
  }

  .prose .lede {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
  }

  .full-link {
    margin: 1.5rem 0 2.5rem;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }

  .why-section {
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
    padding-top: 2rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--rule);
    max-width: 65ch;
  }

  .why-section h2 {
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
  }

  .why-section p {
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }
</style>
